  m_Name: Snow_ExpertAdvice_1 1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Game.Collectable.CollectableItem
  id: Snow_ExpertAdvice_2
  headerName: "Expert Field Notes \u2014 Surviving a Blizzard"
  content: '<size=120%><b>1. If you are outside</b></size>


    * <color=#cc6600><b>Run
    away:</b></color> Run, if you can see it coming.

    * <color=#cc6600><b>Find
    shelter:</b></color> A building, any enclosed space.

    *<color=#cc6600><b>Tying
    yourself to a tall tree (not recommended):</b></color> You won''t be swept away,
    but exposure and hypothermia will still take you. Slower, but equally fatal.
    Last resort only.


    <size=120%><b>3. Warning Signs</b></size>


    * <color=#cc6600><b>The
    sky turning dark grey:</b></color> Heavy cloud cover swallowing the light rapidly.

    *
    <color=#cc6600><b>Strong, steady wind:</b></color> The wind beginning to lift
    surface snow into a blinding horizontal haze (whiteout).

    * <color=#cc6600><b>A
    sudden, sharp drop in temperature:</b></color> the kind that makes your body
    shudder without permission.'
  type: 0
  biome: 2
  icon: {fileID: 0}
  dialogData: {fileID: 0}
